e the sheets"],[104.26,105.58,"Of your subconscious derling"],[105.58,106.74,"Isn't it a treat?"],[106.9,108.86,"I install myself in places you can't reach"],[108.86,110.32,"Crawl space of your cortex"],[110.32,111.62,"Attic of your grief"],[111.62,114.18,"You built a house inside your head to keep me out"],[114.18,115.84,"But I was already here"],[115.84,119.32,"I picked the lock before you even drew the blueprint,"],[120.04,122.8,"You thought you'd That's fucking cute"],[122.8,125.22,"You thought you'd Not with me in Brazil"],[125.22,127.6,"You thought you'd heal? That's adorable"],[127.6,130.42,"You thought you'd That's deplorable"],[130.42,133.4,"I made myself eternal"],[133.4,136.26,"In the wrecking drum in your journal"],[136.26,139.44,"Went through in tears overdue"],[139.44,139.94,"Oh,"],[140.48,143.52,"I'm living rest free, baby."],[143.98,146.12,"Waffle home, buckle on to me."],[146.38,148.74,"I'm living rest free, honey."],[149.14,151.56,"I'm the Mufflehacker, walls of memory."],[151.98,154.28,"I'm the Mote and Zag, your walls of memory."],[154.64,157.24,"Every flashback smells my perfume sensory."],[157.62,159.46,"Every flashback's got my fingerprints."],[159.9,162.22,"Every time you flinch, that's my influence."],[162.38,164.6,"I'm living rest free."],[165.26,166.62,"And the least is for forever."],[166.62,171.46,"Read the five frames"],[171.46,172.2,"Bust em'"],[172.54,174.06,"Welcome home"],[174.06,174.84,"Bust em'"],[175.82,177.36,"Shh, radio sin"],[177.36,180.72,"It's crowded in here with all my things"],[180.72,183.16,"My mood's in every door"],[183.16,186.2,"My mood's, my needs, my everything"],[186.2,188.62,"My name on every floor"],[188.62,191.54,"But you're never alone now"],[191.54,193.7,"Never truly alone"],[193.7,195.68,"You've got me"],[195.68,201.28,"In every corner, in every pause, in every almost happy moment"],[201.28,203.84,"I'm the butts, I'm except,"],[204.38,206.62,"I'm the hesitation in your breath"],[206.62,209.24,"The almost before your death"],[209.24,217.56,"I'm the reason you can't quite, can't quite, can't quite let go"],[217.56,220.22,"I'm living rent free baby"],[220.22,223.06,"I am home, I am home on me"],[223.06,225.6,"I'm living rent-free, honey"],[225.6,228.72,"I'm the foundation in the tunnels, don't you see?"],[229.02,231.42,"Every happy ending has my name carved through"],[231.42,234.06,"Every happy ending has my name sliced through"],[234.06,235.74,"Every future you picture"],[236.54,239.06,"I'm already in the room"],[239.06,242.76,"Every future you'll match it"],[243.7,248.88,"And then that's how I'm living rent-free"],[249.78,252.72,"And the sickest part, the beautiful part"],[252.72,255.22,"The gorgeous part, the perfect part"],[255.22,257.7,"You still say my name when you come"],[257.7,260.22,"You still leave the light on"],[260.22,264.54,"Just in case I wanna find my way back to your heart"],[265.22,266.48,"Oh, this is nice"],[267.16,268.78,"I could stay here forever"],[269.88,272.02,"Thanks for having me"],[272.72,275.74,"Thanks for still having me"],[275.74,278.16,"In other chains of locks"],[278.72,281.48,"You didn't even know you'd give me keys"],[281.48,284.8,"But I've had coffee since we met"],[285.62,287.98,"You never really wanted to"],[289.32,290.86,"Isn't that romantic?"],[292.42,294.66,"Sweet dreams, landlord"],[296.14,297.5,"This is home"],[299.66,300.66,"Home"],[302.34,303.76,"You're no JJ"]]
